# Stage 7 Backend Integration — real WhatsApp OTP delivery (see supabase/README.md).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (already gitignored, matches Vite's own
# `.env*.local` convention) and fill in real values once a Supabase project
# exists. Placeholders below are not real credentials.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-SUPABASE-ANON-KEY

# Stage 7 correctness fix (2026-09-17) — simulated NFC is dev-only by default
# (`import.meta.env.DEV`). Set to `true` ONLY for a deliberate demo build
# that must fake tag scans on a browser without Web NFC. Never in production:
# a simulated scan commits a fabricated tag id through the real RPC.
# See src/domain/nfcSupport.ts.
# VITE_NFC_SIMULATE=true
